---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Disclaimer | KawaiiPlay';
const description = 'Important disclaimers regarding the games, content, and advertising found on KawaiiPlay.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} path="/disclaimer/">
  <main class="container">
    <article class="content-page">
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="updated-note">Last updated: January 2026</p>

      <h2>1. General Information</h2>
      <p>The information and games provided on KawaiiPlay (ubg2028.github.io) are for general entertainment purposes only. We make no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, about the completeness, accuracy, reliability, or availability of the Site or the games embedded on it.</p>

      <h2>2. Third-Party Games</h2>
      <p>Many games on this Site are hosted or developed by third parties and embedded via iframe. KawaiiPlay does not develop, own, or control this third-party game content and is not responsible for any bugs, downtime, in-game purchases, or content within those games. All trademarks and game titles belong to their respective owners.</p>

      <h2>3. External Links</h2>
      <p>The Site may contain links to external websites, including partner networks in our footer. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of any linked third-party site.</p>

      <h2>4. Advertising Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>KawaiiPlay displays advertisements served by third-party networks, including Google AdSense. We do not endorse and are not responsible for the products, services, or claims made in third-party advertisements.</p>

      <h2>5. No Professional Advice</h2>
      <p>Nothing on this Site constitutes professional advice of any kind. Use of the Site and any games is entirely at your own risk.</p>

      <h2>6. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this Disclaimer can be sent through our <a href="/contact-us/">Contact Us</a> page.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
